
%% VLBOT
#volcano-bottom
(room *)
(name *)	Volcano Bottom
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are at the bottom of a large dormant volcano. High above you light
	may be seen entering from the cone of the volcano. The only exit here is
	to the north.
(from * go #north to #lava-room)

%% VAIR1
#volcano-core1
(room *)
(name *)	Volcano Core
(inherently dark *)
(* is midair)
(* is sacred)
(look *)
	You are about one hundred feet above the bottom of the volcano. The top
	of the volcano is clearly visible here.
%%(from * go ##!#!# to #thing)

%% VAIR2
#volcano-core2
(room *)
(name *)	Volcano Core
(inherently dark *)
(* is midair)
(* is sacred)
(look *)
	You are about two hundred feet above the volcano floor. Looming above is
	the rim of the volcano. There is a small ledge on the west side.
(from * go #west to #narrow-ledge)
(from * go #land to #narrow-ledge)

%% VAIR3
#volcano-core3
(room *)
(name *)	Volcano Core
(inherently dark *)
(* is midair)
(* is sacred)
(look *)
	You are high above the floor of the volcano. From here the rim of the
	volcano looks very narrow and you are very near it. To the east is what
	appears to be a viewing ledge, too thin to land on.
%%(from * go ##!#!# to #thing)

%% VAIR4
#volcano-core4
(room *)
(name *)	Volcano Core
(inherently dark *)
(* is midair)
(* is sacred)
(look *)
	You are near the rim of the volcano which is only about 15 feet across.
	To the west, there is a place to land on a wide ledge.
(from * go #land to #wide-ledge)
(from * go #east to #wide-ledge)

%% LEDG2
#narrow-ledge
(room *)
(name *)	Narrow Ledge
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are on a narrow ledge overlooking the inside of an old dormant
	volcano. This ledge appears to be about in the middle between the floor
	below and the rim above. There is an exit here to the south.
(narrate failing to leave * #down)
	I wouldn't jump from here.
(from * go #launch to #volcano-core2)
(from * go #west to #volcano-bottom)
%% TODO: conditional on flag GNOME-DOOR
(prevent [from * go #west])
	~(gnome-door)
		You can't go that way.
(from * go #south to #library)

%% LEDG3
#volcano-view
(room *)
(name *)	Volcano View
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are on a ledge in the middle of a large volcano. Below you the
	volcano bottom can be seen and above is the rim of the volcano. A couple
	of ledges can be seen on the other side of the volcano; it appears that
	this ledge is intermediate in elevation between those on the other side.
	The exit from this room is to the east.
(narrate failing to leave * #down)
	I wouldn't try that.
(narrate failing to leave * #cross)
	It is impossible to cross this distance.
(from * go #east to #egyptian-room)

%% LEDG4
#wide-ledge
(room *)
(name *)	Wide Ledge
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	%% TODO: description comes from room routine LEDGE-FUNCTION
%% TODO: room action routine LEDGE-FUNCTION
(narrate failing to leave * #down)
	It's a long way down.
(from * go #launch to #volcano-core4)
(from * go #west to #volcano-bottom)
%% TODO: conditional on flag GNOME-DOOR
(prevent [from * go #west])
	~(gnome-door)
		You can't go that way.
(from * go #south to #dusty-room)

%% SAFE
#dusty-room
(room *)
(name *)	Dusty Room
(look *)
	%% TODO: description comes from room routine SAFE-ROOM
%% TODO: room action routine SAFE-ROOM
(from * go #north to #wide-ledge)

%% LAVA
#lava-room
(room *)
(name *)	Lava Room
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are in a small room, whose walls are formed by an old lava flow.
	There are exits here to the west and the south.
(from * go #south to #volcano-bottom)
(from * go #west to #ruby-room)

