%% CARD
#card
(* is #in #box)
(name *)	card
(item *)
(readable *)
(flammable *)
(dict *)	note card
(* size is 1)
(appearance *)
	There is a card with writing on it here.
(descr *)
	Warning: This room was constructed over very weak rock strata.
	Detonation of explosives in this room is strictly prohibited! Frobozz
	Magic Cave Company per M. Agrippa, foreman

