(appearance *)
	Lord Dimwit's crown is here.
(initial appearance *)
	The excessively gaudy crown of Lord Dimwit Flathead is here.

%% LIBRA
#library
(room *)
(name *)	Library
(inherently dark *)
(look *)
	You are in a room which must have been a large library, probably for the
	royal family. All of the shelves appear to have been gnawed to pieces by
	unfriendly gnomes. To the north is an exit.
(from * go #north to #narrow-ledge)
(from * go #out to #narrow-ledge)

