%% BLABE
#blue-label
(* is #in #basket2)
(name *)	blue label
(item *)
(readable *)
(flammable *)
(dict *)	label blue blabe
(* size is 1)
(appearance *)
	There is a blue label here.
(descr *)
	!!!! FROBOZZ MAGIC BALLOON COMPANY !!!! Hello, Aviator! Instructions for
	use: To get into balloon, say 'Board' To leave balloon, say 'Disembark'
	To land, say 'Land' Warranty: No warranty is expressed or implied.
	You're on your own, sport! Good Luck.

